											"$text": "# UICS Secure Terminal Access Credentials\r\n\r\n## Authorized Users List\r\n\r\n- **Guest**\r\n  - Username: Guest\r\n  - Password: accessUICS\r\n  - Note: Restricted view-only access. Permitted to read non-sensitive operational bulletins and public directives.\r\n\r\n- **Meteorologist**\r\n  - Username: Meteorologist\r\n  - Password: METEO_UICS@Quarry\r\n  - Note: Exclusive access to all weather data collected over the past view month. Otherwise same access level as guest.\r\n\r\n- **Admin**\r\n  - Username: Admin\r\n  - Password: UICS@Root1\r\n  - Note: Full administrative control. Grants access to secure command functions, encrypted channels, and terminal override capabilities.",
